Kadoka Quest - Licensing Notice

Copyright (c) 2026 tomiya7688

This repository contains several components with different license terms.
The project is still being reorganized, so LICENSE_SCOPE.md defines the current
provisional boundary between those components.

1. Developer Tools

Files identified as Developer Tools in LICENSE_SCOPE.md are licensed under the
MIT License. See LICENSES/MIT.txt.

The Developer Tools may be used, modified, redistributed, sublicensed, and sold
under the terms of the MIT License.

2. Kadoka Quest Game

Kadoka Quest itself, including game code, game data, game assets, story/content,
and other material identified as Kadoka Quest Game material, is governed by
LICENSES/KADOKA-GAME.txt unless a more specific license notice applies.

This license is intended for Kadoka Quest as the original game, not for games
created from its development framework.

3. Created Games

Games created using the Kadoka Quest Developer Tools, runtime, templates, or
Kadoka Quest material under the creation permission are governed by
LICENSES/KADOKA-GAME-CREATION.txt.

A Created Game may be commercially distributed and sold without royalty.
A Created Game may remain very similar to Kadoka Quest. For example, changing
only the characters, only the maps, only the story/content, or another meaningful
part of the game is permitted while keeping the remaining systems and content.

Merely renaming, rebranding, repackaging, or redistributing an otherwise
unchanged copy of Kadoka Quest does not make it a Created Game.

4. No License Expansion by Tool Modification

Modifying the MIT-licensed Developer Tools does not expand the rights granted
over Kadoka Quest game material.

A modified tool cannot make additional Kadoka Quest material freely reusable
merely by copying, exporting, generating, or embedding that material. Rights to
Kadoka Quest material are determined by LICENSES/KADOKA-GAME.txt,
LICENSES/KADOKA-GAME-CREATION.txt, LICENSE_SCOPE.md, and any more specific
license notice that applies to that material.

5. Third-Party Material

Third-party libraries, assets, fonts, audio, and other third-party materials
remain governed by their own licenses or permissions. Nothing in these licenses
grants rights that the Kadoka Quest project does not own.

6. Names and Branding

No trademark rights are granted. A Created Game must not falsely claim to be an
official Kadoka Quest release, sequel, update, or product endorsed by the
Kadoka Quest project.

A truthful descriptive statement such as "created with Kadoka Quest developer
tools" is permitted if it does not imply official status.

7. Provisional Repository Boundary

Because the Developer Tools and the game are not yet fully separated,
LICENSE_SCOPE.md currently determines which repository files belong to each
license category.

A more specific license notice in a file or directory takes precedence over
this top-level notice for that material.
